{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21369","headline":"送东川马逢侍御使回十韵 · 元稹","name":"送东川马逢侍御使回十韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风水荆门阔，文章蜀地豪。\n眼青宾礼重，眉白衆情高。\n思勇曾吞笔，投虚惯用刀。\n词锋倚天劒，学海驾云涛。\n南郡传纱帐，东方让锦袍。\n旋吟新乐府，便续古离骚。\n雪岸犹封草，春江欲满槽。\n饯筵君置醴，随俗我餔糟。\n莫叹巴三峡，休惊鬓二毛。\n流年等头过，人世各劳劳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21369.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21369","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}